- Joo Belle-Fille doon.

1744
01:12:13.871 --> 01:12:15.122
{\an8}Iyan ay kahanga-hanga.

1745
01:12:15.205 --> 01:12:16.373
Paano mo nalaman ito?

1746
01:12:16.457 --> 01:12:17.708
- Magaling ka, Isang Detective.
- naku.

1747
