1796
01:14:15.576 --> 01:14:17.828
{\an8}- ng testator na si Jang Breadwinner."
- Ay naku.

1797
01:14:17.911 --> 01:14:19.746
{\an8}Mas gusto kong pumasok na lang doon.

1798
01:14:19.830 --> 01:14:22.916
